OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric justice museum to close
OL,4,Aafter financial woes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum dedicated to the history of
OL,7,Fjustice and home to the courtroom where
OL,8,Fthe Tolpuddle Martyrs were tried is set
OL,9,Fto close after years of financial
OL,10,Fstruggles.
OL,12,FThe Shire Hall Museum opened in
OL,13,FDorchester's historic Shire Hall in May
OL,14,F2018 following a #2.9m revamp of the
OL,15,FGrade I listed building.
OL,17,FIn a statement, museum trustee Rose
OL,18,FWallis said "several years of
OL,19,Fchallenging economic conditions",
OL,20,Fincluding increasing costs associated
OL,21,Fwith managing its Grade I listed
OL,22,Fbuilding, contributed to the decision.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
